<title>FRANCE: GdE aims to conclude Time Warner talks in weeks.</title>
<headline>GdE aims to conclude Time Warner talks in weeks.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux chairman Jean-Marie Messier said on Friday that he aimed to conclude talks with Time Warner about the possible sale of French cable television unit Compagnie Generale de Videocommunication within four to six weeks.</p>
<p>&quot;The discussions are going on. We will see in four to six weeks whether they lead to something,&quot; Messier told reporters in the margin of a shareholders meeting of Havas.</p>
</text>
